HST Office: HST Draw's classic menu bar can be shown and hidden from the View menu and the "≡" menu.

HST Draw opens with the HST ribbon and no classic menu bar ("Thanh trình đơn"), like Writer, Sheets and Slides
(hst-ribbon-draw.patch). As hst-menubar-toggle.patch does for those three, .uno:Menubar is added to Draw's View
menu, after Giao diện người dùng, and becomes the first item of the "≡" menu at the right end of the tab row. The
"≡" menu loses Mới, Gần đây and Đóng (the File tab has them) and the user-interface and toolbar choosers (the View
menu and the ribbon's View tab keep them), as the project owner decided on 2026-11-13. The toggle itself, which
does nothing without a ribbon, and the Alt/F10 handling while the menu bar shows are in hst-menubar-toggle.patch.

License: modified upstream files keep their license (MPL-2.0).

